OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFog across southern UK will
OL,6,Fslowly clear, lingering into early
OL,7,Fafternoon in places. Showers continue
OL,8,Fnear Irish Sea and North Sea coasts,
OL,9,Fwhile rain and drizzle fade in
OL,10,Fnorthern England. Brighter for many,
OL,11,Fthough locally chilly where fog
OL,12,Fpersists.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FLargely dry with variable
OL,15,Fcloud and a few eastern showers. Fog
OL,16,Fmay become dense overnight, with
OL,17,Fpatchy frost. Winds strengthen in the
OL,18,Ffar southwest, where it turns milder
OL,19,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
