OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FMist and fog may be slow to
OL,6,Fclear, especially in central areas.
OL,7,FIsolated coastal showers. Turning
OL,8,Fcloudier in the southwest with rain
OL,9,Flater. Temperatures near normal,
OL,10,Fthough cold in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
